  "description": "Count triplets (i, j, k) such that 0 <= i < j < k < n, |arr[i] - arr[j]| <= a, |arr[j] - arr[k]| <= b, and |arr[i] - arr[k]| <= c.",
  "target": "a=7, b=2, c=3",
  "pseudocode": "1. count = 0\n2. for i from 0 to n-3:\n3.   for j from i+1 to n-2:\n4.     if |arr[i] - arr[j]| <= a:\n5.       for k from j+1 to n-1:\n6.         if |arr[j] - arr[k]| <= b and |arr[i] - arr[k]| <= c:\n7.           count++",
